      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.80 (down from ₹0.85 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹3.08b (up 18% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹379.9m (down 5.8% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 12% (down from 16% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 3% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
